%% examples/flowchart-interaction.srn — a flowchart's `click` statements:
%% `href` and `call`, each with and without the trailing tooltip string.
%% Those are the only two forms Siren draws; `link`/`callback` are not valid
%% flowchart Mermaid at all (measured), and the target attribute, the bare
%% callback-name shorthand and a tooltip-only click are backlog — see the
%% `fc-click-target`, `fc-click-bare-callback` and `fc-click-tooltip-only`
%% rows in `packages/core/src/compat/corpus.ts`.

flowchart TB
  Docs[Read the docs]
  Support[Contact support]
  Details[View order details]
  Confirm[Confirm the order]

  Docs --> Support
  Support --> Details
  Details --> Confirm

  click Docs href "https://example.com/docs"
  click Support href "https://example.com/support" "Opens in a new tab"
  click Details call showDetails()
  click Confirm call confirmOrder("42") "Places the order"
